    {
      "Nomor_ayat": 6134,
      "Ayat_Arabic": "وَمَا تَفَرَّقَ الَّذِيْنَ اُوْتُوا الْكِتٰبَ اِلَّا مِنْۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَاۤءَتْهُمُ الْبَيِّنَةُ ۗ",
      "Text_Latin": "wa ma tafarraqallazina utul-kitaba illa mim ba'di ma ja'at-humul-bayyinah",
      "Terjemah_in": "Tidaklah terpecah-belah orang-orang Ahlulkitab, melainkan setelah datang kepada mereka bukti yang nyata.",
      "Terjemahan_En": "Those who were given the Scripture did not splinter, except after the Clear Evidence came to them.",
